<title>USA: Centennial Tech resumes, shrs fall 75 pct.</title>
<headline>Centennial Tech resumes, shrs fall 75 pct.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Centennial Technologies Inc shares resumed trading on the New York Stock Exchange Tuesday, opening at 4-1/8, off about 75 percent from their last trade eight days ago.</p>
<p>The shares had been halted since February 11, when Centennial announced that previous financial statements had included material misstatements.</p>
<p>The shares closed at 16-3/8 on the new York Stock Exchange Febuary 10. Later that same day the shares closed at 16-1/2 on the Pacific Stock Exchange.</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street Desk, 212-859-1730))</p>
